B.a9Y=new A.JC("Taming the storm","Tame the Storm","The nervous system can feel like weather you did not choose. Taming it means learning the shape of that weather: when to slow down, when to stay, and when a tool stays closed. Like Sun Wukong learning to hold his own chaos, this is practice in self-regulation.",null,null)
