B.O2=new A.b_(63457,!1)
B.a9N=new A.qz(4,"Hear","Close your eyes if that feels safe. Find 4 things you can hear.\n\nNear and far. Notice the sounds without judgement.",B.O2)
B.a9P=new A.qz(3,"Touch","Find 3 things you can feel right now \u2014 the chair beneath you, the fabric on your skin, the air temperature.\n\nPress your feet into the floor if that helps.",B.lh)
B.a9O=new A.qz(2,"Smell","Find 2 things you can smell, or remember scents that feel safe and familiar to you.\n\nTake a slow breath in through your nose.",B.qx)
